/-!
# Standard covers on affine Zariski sites

Convenience import for finite standard distinguished-open cover data and the
resulting big and small affine Zariski pretopologies. Import `Cover.Basic` for
only the topology-independent cover-to-presieve constructions, `Cover.Big`
for the big affine site, or `Cover.Small` for the small affine site.
